.\" Distro-authored man page for the Fedora pidp8i package.
.\" Candidate for upstreaming to the PiDP-8/I project.
.TH TXT2PTP 1 "November 21, 2026" "PiDP-8/I" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
txt2ptp \- punch text into a PDP-8 paper-tape image
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B txt2ptp
.RI [ file ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B txt2ptp
is the text-to-paper-tape direction of the
.BR ptp2txt (1)
conversion pair: it reads readable PDP-8 tape text and writes the
punched
.I .pt
/
.I .ptp
image, leader, information block and parity included. With no file
arguments it filters stdin to stdout.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ptp2txt (1),
.BR palbart (1)
